{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FOOSBALL HAS NEVER BEEN THIS FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pimbolas is a local multiplayer party game where you can play fast-paced foosball matches in different arenas, using various power-ups to help you win and become a true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/extras/pimbolas.gif?t=1743193937\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 15 different power-ups to spice up your matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various arenas to compete in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your players with different items and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play against the CPU as well</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take full control of your foosball game! Pimbolas uses the analog sticks and triggers of your controller, allowing you to move, hit the ball, and spin to victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pimbolas is developed by <strong>Nano Knight Studio</strong>, an independent game studio dedicated to creating fun experiences for you to enjoy with your friends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621200?t=1743193937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/ad8fb810e6d8053546f7c31d1d4069139207fa06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743193937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/4d5d2183aacff67b91f2d3e7e99e6f06b6a38d9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743193937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/4d5d2183aacff67b91f2d3e7e99e6f06b6a38d9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743193937","categor